## Independence and licensing

VMap Studio is an independent implementation inspired by the *workflow* of classic desktop
mind-mapping tools. It contains no XMind source code or assets and is not affiliated with
or endorsed by XMind Ltd. or any other vendor. Built-in themes and icons are original
(themes are CC0-1.0; icons are drawn in code).

**No project license has been chosen yet.** Add a `LICENSE` file before distributing.
PySide6/Qt are used under the LGPLv3.
